    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuramukya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe Paulo, Ruhanga ou yagondeze mbe mukwenda wa Kristo Yesu, hamu na Timoteho mugenzi waitu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitubahandiikira inywe abantu ba Ruhanga kandi bagenzi baitu abeesigwa abali Kolosai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitubagondeza omugisa n'obusinge ebiruga hali Ruhanga iitwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naasiima Ruhanga habw'okwikiriza kwabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butoosa obu tuba nitubasabira, tusiima Ruhanga, Ise MUKAMA waitu Yesu Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba tukahurra nkooku murukwikiriza Kristo Yesu, n'oku murukugonza abantu ba Ruhanga boona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimusigikira ha kunihira oku mwina nukwo mutunge ebirungi ebimwahuliirwe omwiguru. Okunihira oku mwahuliireho kara omu nyegesa y'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nugo Amakuru Amarungi agabahikireho, kandi agarukweyongera muno nigararanga omunsi yoona. Gakeeyongera gati omuli inywe okuruga ha kiro eki mwabandiizeho kuhurra n'okwetegereza kwo embabazi za Ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bak 4:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHM.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 1:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkooku mwayegesiibwe Epafura, omuheereza mugenzi wange omugonzibwa. Habwange nuwe muheereza omwesigwa wa Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayaizire okutumanyisa engonzi Mwoyo Ahikiriire ezi yabatairemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki okuruga obu twakihuliire, titukoosaga kubasabira, nukwo mwetegerereze kimu Ruhanga ebi agonza, kandi mwijule amagezi goona n'okumanya kwona okurukuleetwa Mwoyo wa Ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mugire engeso ezisemeriire MUKAMA, mukole ebi asiima, mweyongere omu birungi byona ebi murukukora, kandi mweyongere kumanya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ow'obusobozi bwona abagumye habw'amaani ag'ekitiinisa kye, nukwo mugire obumanzi bwona kandi mugumiisirize n'okusemererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musiime Isiitwe ayatusoboize kubagana ha bugwetwa bw'abahikiriire abali omu bukama bw'omusana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe yatwihire omu bukama obw'omwirima, yatutaahya omu bukama bw'Omwana we omugonzibwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bef 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyakutucungura kandi anyakutuganyira ebibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kristo nuwe mukuru w'ebintu byona",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 7:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo nuwe kisisani kya Ruhanga atarorwa, omuzigaijo gw'ebihangwa byona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba omuli uwe, byona nuho byahangiirwe: eby'omu iguru n'eby'omu nsi; ebiboneka n'ebitaboneka; rundi ebitebe by'abamalaika abakuru, ab'obusobozi, n'abalemi-ebintu byona bikahangirwa omuli uwe kandi bikahangwa habwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe yabandize kubaho byona bitakabaireho, kandi ebintu byona biteeranira omuli uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.1.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bef 1:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.1.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe mutwe gw'omubiri-kandi omubiri ogu nikyo kitebe ky'abaikiriza. Nuwe ntandiko kandi omuzigaijo ogw'abahumbuukire omu bafu, nukwo omu byona nuwe abe w'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba Ruhanga akagonza Kristo we aijurre kimu obwa Ruhanga bwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.2.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bef 2:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi akacwamu kwegarurra ebintu byona, eby'omu nsi rundi eby'omu iguru naaraba omuli uwe, obu yaleesire obusinge habw'esagama y'omwana we eyasirwe ha musaraba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe kara, mukaba mwebaganiize na Ruhanga, mwina obunyanzigwa omu mitima yanyu kandi, nimukora ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu hati mugarukangainemu na Ruhanga omu mubiri gw'omwana we habw'okufa kwe, nukwo abahikye omumaiso ge nimwera, mutaina kamogo, kandi mutaina eki murukujunaanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonka mwikale omu kwikiriza, mugumire kandi mutarukutengeeta, mutarukuruga ha kwesiga Amakuru Amarungi aga mwahuliire, agaarangiriirwe buli kihangwa ekinyakuli omunsi, amakuru nyowe Paulo aga nafookere omuheereza waago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuheereza bwa Paulo hali Abakolosai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati ninsemererwa kurora nimbonabona habwanyu, habwokuba nimpikiriza n'omubiri gwange ebirukubura ha mabone Kristo aga yaboine habw'omubiri gwe-nikyo kitebe ky'abaikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe eki nikyo nakomiirwe kuba muheereza wakyo nk'omulimo gwa Ruhanga ogu naahairwe habwanyu oku guli, nukwo mmanyisize kimu ekigambo kya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egi niyo nsita eyaserekerwe ira lyona n'obusinge bwona, baitu hati enyakwolekerwe abantu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubo Ruhanga yagondeze kwoleka ensita egi nkooku ina ekitiinisa kingi omu Banyamahanga. Ensita egi nuwe Kristo anyakuli omuli inywe, omukwato gwaitu ogulitutungisa ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe turukurangirra, nitwegesa kandi nituteererra buli muntu n'amagezi goona, nukwo weena anyakuhikire tusobole kumuleeta hali Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo ndukutalibanira kandi nikyo ndukwekambira n'amaani goona Ruhanga aga arukunnyijuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
